id: CTB-SRC0015-9-1
source: SRC-0015
section: §9.1
kind: requirement
extends: LXM-REQ-000041
text: First complete the currently outstanding CI requirement on the exact existing PR #6 head. Do not alter CI, Docker or toolchain configuration in a way that invalidates the active release evidence before that requirement is closed, except when necessary to remediate a verified critical issue.
